WEBVTT

00:14.800 --> 00:18.170
[Four years ago]

00:16.640 --> 00:17.550
Thank you.

00:18.390 --> 00:19.510
Hey, young man.

00:20.350 --> 00:21.030
This herb

00:21.390 --> 00:22.440
is coffee senna,

00:22.440 --> 00:23.510
not cassia seed.

00:23.760 --> 00:25.030
Although they look similar,

00:25.030 --> 00:25.920
their properties are different.

00:25.920 --> 00:27.160
They shouldn't be mixed up.

00:27.160 --> 00:27.920
I'm not wrong.

00:27.920 --> 00:29.070
It is cassia seed.

00:29.390 --> 00:30.720
The gentleman is right.

00:30.960 --> 00:32.159
Apologize to him now.

00:32.670 --> 00:33.520
I'm sorry, Sir.

00:33.520 --> 00:34.320
It's nothing.

00:36.140 --> 00:36.940
Thank you.

00:38.370 --> 00:39.220
Mr. Zhou.

00:40.030 --> 00:40.890
I didn't expect

00:41.150 --> 00:42.390
you to know about medicine.

00:42.390 --> 00:44.200
I've read some medical books before

00:44.200 --> 00:45.430
and studied a bit

00:45.750 --> 00:46.670
for my wife's illness.

00:46.670 --> 00:49.470
With someone like you
taking such good care of her,

00:49.710 --> 00:50.640
your wife

00:51.030 --> 00:52.490
will surely recover soon.

00:52.750 --> 00:54.350
Thanks for your good wishes.

00:55.280 --> 00:56.070
Wang,

00:56.240 --> 00:57.110
take note.

00:57.610 --> 00:59.500
It's our shop's fault today.

00:59.790 --> 01:01.250
The herbs are on the house.

01:01.350 --> 01:02.630
Miss, we can't do that.

01:02.880 --> 01:03.560
This gentleman

01:03.560 --> 01:05.349
has owed us money several times.

01:05.349 --> 01:06.510
The young master said

01:06.510 --> 01:07.840
he must settle all

01:07.950 --> 01:09.070
his previous debts.

01:09.070 --> 01:10.920
Manager, please give me some time.

01:10.920 --> 01:12.050
Just a few more days.

01:13.000 --> 01:15.039
Don't we have an errand out of town?

01:15.710 --> 01:16.400
Mr. Zhou,

01:16.590 --> 01:18.430
if you are willing to make the trip,

01:18.430 --> 01:20.490
your previous debts will be cleared.

01:22.070 --> 01:23.070
That sounds good.

01:23.150 --> 01:25.039
But my wife needs someone
to take care of her.

01:25.039 --> 01:25.870
I...

01:25.870 --> 01:27.150
The Qian family is big enough

01:27.150 --> 01:28.950
to accommodate one more person.

01:29.340 --> 01:30.700
If Ms. Bai is willing,

01:30.810 --> 01:32.110
she can stay at our house

01:32.110 --> 01:33.479
until you return.

01:33.870 --> 01:35.000
Thank you, Ms. Qian.

01:36.000 --> 01:36.759
Liang!

01:36.789 --> 01:38.390
Pack up Mr. Zhou's medicine.

01:38.430 --> 01:39.039
Sure,

01:39.039 --> 01:39.700
right away!

01:39.960 --> 01:40.920
Thank you.

02:10.030 --> 02:10.680
Excuse me,

02:10.960 --> 02:12.030
where is my wife?

02:12.340 --> 02:13.600
She left with someone.

02:13.910 --> 02:15.020
Who did she leave with?

02:15.020 --> 02:16.440
I heard he's quite wealthy,

02:16.440 --> 02:18.280
from a prominent family.

02:19.250 --> 02:20.790
She might just be a concubine,

02:20.790 --> 02:24.000
but she's set for life now.

02:24.200 --> 02:25.390
Impossible.

02:25.670 --> 02:26.590
Tell me where she went.

02:26.590 --> 02:27.520
I'll go find her.

02:27.960 --> 02:29.000
Don't bother.

02:29.020 --> 02:31.079
You'll only bring trouble upon yourself.

02:31.079 --> 02:31.910
Liang.

02:33.070 --> 02:35.200
The herbs in the yard are blowing away.

02:35.360 --> 02:36.680
I'm on it, Miss Qian.

02:37.120 --> 02:38.430
Ms. Qian.

02:39.030 --> 02:39.960
Mr. Zhou,

02:40.240 --> 02:41.030
it's...

02:41.570 --> 02:43.130
it's my fault.

02:45.170 --> 02:47.520
I couldn't keep Ms. Bai here.

02:49.150 --> 02:50.610
Do you know where she went?

02:52.190 --> 02:54.520
She didn't tell anyone
where she was going.

02:54.520 --> 02:55.680
She just said

02:56.750 --> 02:58.400
she didn't want to suffer anymore.

02:58.400 --> 03:00.150
If she finds a good family,

03:00.750 --> 03:02.430
maybe her illness can be cured.

03:02.430 --> 03:03.710
If you don't stop her,

03:03.830 --> 03:05.390
she can live a good life.

03:06.280 --> 03:07.710
Isn't that a good deed?

03:08.870 --> 03:09.600
I need her...

03:09.750 --> 03:10.910
to tell me herself.

03:11.240 --> 03:12.000
Mr. Zhou!

03:19.170 --> 03:21.230
Ms. Bai asked me to return this to you.

03:25.910 --> 03:26.680
She said

03:28.070 --> 03:29.870
you shouldn't go looking for her,

03:29.870 --> 03:30.730
and that she...

03:33.550 --> 03:35.150
didn't want to see you again.

03:46.500 --> 03:47.410
Mr. Zhou.

03:58.430 --> 03:59.430
Mr. Zhou.

04:00.080 --> 04:01.120
Ms. Bai

04:02.080 --> 04:04.140
just didn't want to be a burden to you.

04:05.310 --> 04:07.510
She just wants you to have a better life.

04:08.840 --> 04:10.240
She has good intentions.

04:11.800 --> 04:13.190
Don't let her down.

04:14.310 --> 04:16.110
I'm the one who dragged her down.

04:18.800 --> 04:20.880
I'm the real burden to her.

06:17.100 --> 06:20.860
[A Prophet]

06:21.430 --> 06:23.820
[Episode 9]

06:26.000 --> 06:27.200
Shangguan Chengming

06:28.240 --> 06:29.570
really deserves to die.

06:32.830 --> 06:33.800
But...

06:35.600 --> 06:36.270
Huaiyi,

06:37.070 --> 06:38.560
there's really no need for us

06:38.560 --> 06:40.510
to clash head-on with those soldiers.

06:40.510 --> 06:41.270
How about

06:42.560 --> 06:44.090
we just cancel the wedding?

06:44.720 --> 06:46.430
We can get Huaijin and the others

06:46.430 --> 06:47.310
and run away.

06:48.190 --> 06:49.250
Come life or death,

06:50.320 --> 06:51.320
I will follow you.

06:51.630 --> 06:52.830
But I promised

06:54.470 --> 06:57.740
to marry you with a grand ceremony.

06:58.600 --> 06:59.310
That

07:00.130 --> 07:01.590
would be too unfair to you.

07:02.360 --> 07:04.560
I'm already wearing the wedding dress.

07:05.090 --> 07:06.120
Wedding or not,

07:07.070 --> 07:08.260
I am already yours.

07:16.240 --> 07:18.240
The auspicious time is almost here.

07:18.360 --> 07:20.310
Let's perform the wedding ceremony first.

07:20.310 --> 07:21.480
You are my woman.

07:21.910 --> 07:24.110
I will never let you get hurt.

07:46.620 --> 07:48.250
You can fool my sister,

07:48.750 --> 07:49.950
but you can't fool me.

07:51.000 --> 07:52.800
I'm Qian Lao'er!

07:53.270 --> 07:54.920
Do I look easily scared?

07:56.190 --> 07:58.950
To hell with Commander Feng!

08:00.600 --> 08:01.160
Do you know

08:01.160 --> 08:02.830
why I didn't shoot you?

08:04.800 --> 08:05.720
Shooting you dead

08:05.720 --> 08:07.580
would be letting you off too easy.

08:08.110 --> 08:10.110
I have to hand you over to my brother.

08:10.160 --> 08:11.040
Go down below

08:11.510 --> 08:12.480
and chat

08:13.390 --> 08:14.240
with him.

08:15.360 --> 08:16.560
Set a fire

08:16.930 --> 08:18.970
and escape with your family in the chaos.

08:18.970 --> 08:20.480
Even if Commander Feng catches you,

08:20.480 --> 08:22.120
you can say it was an accident

08:22.600 --> 08:25.000
and that my death
had nothing to do with you.

08:28.360 --> 08:30.750
You're smarter than I thought.

08:32.110 --> 08:33.360
But let me tell you,

08:34.080 --> 08:35.030
it's useless.

08:35.720 --> 08:36.390
In a while,

08:36.990 --> 08:38.590
you'll be nothing but ashes.

08:38.909 --> 08:40.240
You won't know anything

08:40.750 --> 08:42.390
about what happens next.

08:43.549 --> 08:45.080
So stop worrying.

08:54.510 --> 08:56.480
Enjoy it.

09:21.670 --> 09:23.320
The wedding begins!

09:23.720 --> 09:25.380
First bow to Heaven and Earth!

09:31.000 --> 09:32.600
Second bow to the parents!

09:47.790 --> 09:49.790
Husband and wife, bow to each other!

09:59.910 --> 10:01.840
Escort them to the bridal chamber!

10:06.150 --> 10:07.390
Ceremony complete!

10:13.670 --> 10:14.200
Wenxin!

10:14.200 --> 10:15.000
Chengming!

10:16.200 --> 10:17.030
Hold on!

10:19.010 --> 10:19.650
Hurry!

10:32.390 --> 10:32.910
Go!

10:32.910 --> 10:34.630
Go!

10:43.920 --> 10:44.710
Wenxin.

10:45.860 --> 10:47.080
Thank you for saving my life today.

10:47.080 --> 10:48.540
I'm just glad you're okay.

10:49.510 --> 10:50.670
You didn't kill their brother.

10:50.670 --> 10:51.800
Why did you confess?

10:51.870 --> 10:52.440
Wenxin,

10:52.830 --> 10:54.100
how do you know I didn't kill him?

10:54.100 --> 10:55.610
Because I took the ledger.

10:55.640 --> 10:56.770
In less than 2 hours,

10:56.930 --> 10:59.240
Commander Feng will be here
with his guard battalion.

10:59.240 --> 10:59.960
I'll introduce you

10:59.960 --> 11:00.840
to him then.

11:01.000 --> 11:02.240
I'll go get it for you now.

11:02.240 --> 11:02.670
Okay.

11:02.690 --> 11:03.510
Let's split up.

11:03.510 --> 11:04.030
Okay.

11:21.150 --> 11:22.030
Zhou Wenxin.

11:27.610 --> 11:28.260
Master.

11:28.700 --> 11:30.900
Weren't you drinking in the front yard?

11:31.960 --> 11:33.360
I'll take you to someone.

11:33.600 --> 11:34.720
Master, I don't have time.

11:34.720 --> 11:35.720
Let's talk later.

11:36.090 --> 11:36.920
Bai Wenlan.

13:23.840 --> 13:25.170
I am Zhou Wenxin.

13:25.790 --> 13:27.240
I am Zhou Wenxin.

13:27.300 --> 13:29.090
I am Zhou Wenxin.

13:30.480 --> 13:31.960
I am Zhou Wenxin.

13:32.080 --> 13:33.320
I am Zhou Wenxin.

13:52.320 --> 13:53.600
I am Zhou Wenxin.

14:10.200 --> 14:12.790
From what they said, I thought...

14:12.820 --> 14:13.940
I'm sorry.

14:16.010 --> 14:16.860
I'm sorry.

14:30.150 --> 14:31.660
I really am Wenxin!

14:31.680 --> 14:32.890
I am Wenxin!

14:32.920 --> 14:34.630
I am Wenxin!

14:40.870 --> 14:44.240
I'm sorry!

15:06.950 --> 15:07.880
I'm sorry.

15:08.480 --> 15:09.320
I'm sorry.

15:30.380 --> 15:31.420
How about

15:31.670 --> 15:32.710
I trade this

15:33.020 --> 15:33.950
for your ledger?

15:58.700 --> 15:59.700
You're in danger.

15:59.770 --> 16:00.700
Come with me now.

16:03.390 --> 16:04.590
Something happened!

16:05.750 --> 16:06.950
Something happened!

16:08.600 --> 16:09.800
Something happened!

16:10.800 --> 16:11.510
It's nothing.

16:11.510 --> 16:12.240
Please continue, everyone.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.440
Something happened!

16:14.480 --> 16:15.560
Keep your voice down.

16:15.560 --> 16:16.110
What's wrong?

16:16.110 --> 16:17.640
Something happened in the dungeon.

16:17.640 --> 16:19.970
Take some men to check it out immediately.

16:20.020 --> 16:20.660
Huaiyi.

16:21.440 --> 16:23.040
Is everything okay, Huaiyi?

16:23.200 --> 16:24.000
It's fine.

16:24.110 --> 16:25.540
Keep eating.

16:32.460 --> 16:34.100
Hello, how can I help you?

16:34.180 --> 16:35.040
I want to deposit money.

16:35.040 --> 16:39.570
One moment. After checking the accounts,
I'll hand you the deposit certificate.

16:49.550 --> 16:50.120
Huaiyi.

16:50.750 --> 16:51.320
Huaiyi.

17:05.859 --> 17:06.420
Huaijin,

17:07.410 --> 17:08.170
leave now.

17:10.349 --> 17:11.000
Where to?

17:11.400 --> 17:12.960
I don't have time to explain right now.

17:12.960 --> 17:14.640
Listen to me and leave immediately.

17:14.640 --> 17:15.700
What about Wenxin?

17:15.790 --> 17:16.940
I have to take him with me.

17:16.940 --> 17:18.390
In this situation...

17:18.589 --> 17:19.160
Huaiyi!

17:19.160 --> 17:20.960
I have to take him with me!

18:11.400 --> 18:12.290
Commander Feng's men are here.

18:12.290 --> 18:13.820
Stop talking and leave now!

18:29.920 --> 18:32.120
Sect Master invites you to watch a play.

18:45.310 --> 18:46.510
Get up and look at me!

18:47.360 --> 18:50.030
Huaiyi!

18:53.200 --> 18:54.510
Murder!

18:54.510 --> 18:56.070
He killed someone!

19:33.730 --> 19:36.250
Look at me, Huaiyi!

19:40.160 --> 19:40.990
Qian Huaijin.

19:42.700 --> 19:43.740
Qian Huaijin!

19:45.680 --> 19:46.880
This is what you meant

19:48.170 --> 19:50.330
by her leaving with a rich man, right?

19:53.470 --> 19:55.190
Huaiyi was right.

19:57.800 --> 19:59.360
You are...

20:01.240 --> 20:03.110
an ungrateful man.

20:04.530 --> 20:05.960
After all these years,

20:07.000 --> 20:09.240
how did I not see clearly that you are

20:09.760 --> 20:12.520
a wolf in sheep's clothing?

20:12.550 --> 20:15.070
After all these years...

20:18.110 --> 20:21.590
am I still no match for a village woman?

20:21.670 --> 20:23.600
So you poisoned, muted,

20:25.030 --> 20:26.400
and blinded her?

20:26.550 --> 20:28.640
Poisoned, muted, and blinded her?

20:28.640 --> 20:30.480
I don't know! I don't know!

20:32.220 --> 20:34.260
I was just telling my brother...

20:35.400 --> 20:36.510
that I liked you

20:37.550 --> 20:39.510
and wanted to be with you.

20:41.190 --> 20:43.710
You've got your eyes on her man.

20:43.740 --> 20:46.060
Why don't you send his woman away?

20:46.720 --> 20:48.720
As far away as possible.

20:49.270 --> 20:50.360
Okay.

20:51.320 --> 20:52.920
I will

20:53.390 --> 20:55.870
take her to a good place.

20:56.310 --> 20:57.790
Drop the act!

20:58.050 --> 20:59.770
All this chanting and fasting

20:59.870 --> 21:01.440
is all fake!

21:01.440 --> 21:02.310
Fake!

21:02.310 --> 21:04.030
Your body and your heart are mine!

21:04.030 --> 21:05.550
All mine!

21:07.600 --> 21:08.950
For all these years,

21:09.640 --> 21:10.830
I gave you the best.

21:10.830 --> 21:13.720
The best food, drinks, and life!

21:13.740 --> 21:15.590
What did I do wrong?

21:18.200 --> 21:19.400
Your mistake is that

21:20.960 --> 21:22.160
I never

21:22.720 --> 21:24.590
loved you at all.

21:31.490 --> 21:35.040
♪ As sleeves rise and fall,
you glance is breathtaking ♪

21:35.060 --> 21:39.230
♪ You brush the dust away,
staying just for me ♪

21:39.460 --> 21:44.110
♪ I sing of spring on stage;
our eyes meet down below ♪

21:44.150 --> 21:47.120
♪ Our hearts silently align ♪

21:47.650 --> 21:50.670
♪ You lift my veil and gaze into my eyes ♪

21:50.690 --> 21:53.650
♪ I bow softly,
toasting our years like wine ♪

21:53.670 --> 21:55.670
♪ On this blessed, auspicious day ♪

21:55.700 --> 21:59.880
♪ I'll wait for you,
with a grand bridal procession ♪

22:05.300 --> 22:09.690
♪ I bid wind and snow farewell,
set my opera robes aside, and run to you ♪

22:09.850 --> 22:13.680
♪ We braided hair and tied our knots;
you could hold me close ♪

22:13.850 --> 22:17.440
♪ Red candles line the hall,
with wedding emblems intertwined ♪

22:17.650 --> 22:22.440
♪ With blushing cheeks,
I entrust you my whole life ♪

22:21.030 --> 22:22.880
Amitabha!

22:23.280 --> 22:27.330
♪ I greet spring breeze, light
bright lamps, still waiting for you ♪

22:27.360 --> 22:31.010
♪ Lift the red silk and hand
our wedding quilt; can you see me? ♪

22:31.040 --> 22:34.930
♪ Through all worldly splendors,
I guard this warm moment ♪

22:35.160 --> 22:40.180
♪ Dawn and dusk,
we live in harmony year on year ♪

22:36.550 --> 22:42.590
It's okay now.

22:54.350 --> 22:55.070
Move.

23:21.880 --> 23:22.640
Move.

23:34.450 --> 23:36.510
Pay your respects to the Sect Master.

24:44.660 --> 24:45.580
You fool.

24:52.650 --> 24:53.650
Your ledger.

24:56.400 --> 24:57.400
I'll trade this

24:57.730 --> 24:58.730
for your ledger.

24:59.160 --> 24:59.920
How about it?

25:00.400 --> 25:01.030
No need.

25:01.880 --> 25:02.800
I have a gun.

25:13.500 --> 25:15.390
Hurry up!

25:43.960 --> 25:44.830
Sect Master, you're indeed

25:44.830 --> 25:47.360
the famous fortune teller
of unerring predictions in the southwest.

25:47.360 --> 25:49.730
Unfazed even if Mount Tai collapses
before you.

25:49.730 --> 25:51.900
Unblinking even if a deer dashes by.

25:52.640 --> 25:53.990
You flatter me.

25:54.400 --> 25:56.640
Commander Feng,
I see you're young and promising,

25:56.640 --> 25:57.880
excelling in both pen and sword.

25:57.880 --> 25:59.880
Your future is limitless.

26:01.200 --> 26:03.200
You praise me too much, Sect Master.

26:04.110 --> 26:05.350
In your opinion,

26:07.640 --> 26:09.270
where does my future lie?

26:09.350 --> 26:11.390
Please tell me your birth date.

26:11.590 --> 26:13.270
The 15th of the 12th lunar month,
28th year of the Guangxu reign,

26:13.270 --> 26:14.290
third quarter of the Rat hour.

26:14.290 --> 26:14.970
Alright.

26:25.510 --> 26:26.790
Strange.

26:27.460 --> 26:28.530
Logically,

26:28.770 --> 26:30.850
you should be from a merchant family,

26:30.880 --> 26:32.110
not the military.

26:32.400 --> 26:33.160
To be honest,

26:33.270 --> 26:34.750
my family has been in business
for generations.

26:34.750 --> 26:35.920
It was by chance that

26:35.940 --> 26:38.340
I abandoned business for the military.

26:38.370 --> 26:39.480
No wonder.

26:40.680 --> 26:42.880
Although you achieved success
at a young age,

26:42.880 --> 26:44.160
you nearly died

26:44.290 --> 26:46.490
on the battlefield at 30.

26:46.790 --> 26:49.790
This shows your fortune does not lie
in the southwest.

26:49.880 --> 26:51.750
You truly have unerring predictions,
Sect Master.

26:51.750 --> 26:52.960
If I'm not mistaken,

26:52.980 --> 26:54.270
you're facing

26:54.270 --> 26:55.400
a big choice.

26:55.720 --> 26:57.270
Choose right, and you will soar.

26:57.270 --> 26:58.920
Choose wrong, and you will be doomed,

26:58.920 --> 27:00.180
even risking your life.

27:00.180 --> 27:01.350
Please enlighten me.

27:01.350 --> 27:02.550
You should head east.

27:02.680 --> 27:03.270
Wuhan?

27:03.290 --> 27:04.270
Further east.

27:09.310 --> 27:10.710
You are truly a master.

27:11.350 --> 27:13.070
If I achieve greatness in the future,

27:13.070 --> 27:14.530
I will reward you heavily.

27:14.920 --> 27:16.720
I should be the one thanking you.

27:17.200 --> 27:19.070
You helped me clean up my sect.

27:19.200 --> 27:21.070
Blind Du went behind my back
and colluded with the Qian family

27:21.070 --> 27:21.830
to sell

27:22.510 --> 27:23.440
opium,

27:23.510 --> 27:24.830
harming many civilians.

27:24.830 --> 27:27.680
He even used your brothers' corpses
to smuggle opium.

27:27.680 --> 27:29.750
It's utterly heartless!

27:30.350 --> 27:33.200
Every single transaction is recorded
in this ledger.

27:33.200 --> 27:33.860
Take a look.

27:33.920 --> 27:34.480
Right.

27:36.640 --> 27:37.470
This is yours.

27:48.550 --> 27:50.410
The Bashen Powder prescription.

27:56.070 --> 27:57.350
What do you mean, Sect Master?

27:57.350 --> 27:59.550
Thanks to your intervention,

27:59.590 --> 28:02.400
the peace of this region
has been preserved.

28:02.680 --> 28:03.830
So this isn't from me.

28:03.830 --> 28:06.360
It's a token of appreciation
from the people.

28:06.640 --> 28:08.750
But with such a big incident
happening to the Qian family,

28:08.750 --> 28:09.640
I still need to give an explanation

28:09.640 --> 28:11.070
when my superiors ask.

28:11.070 --> 28:11.750
Of course.

28:12.270 --> 28:12.960
Look.

28:28.790 --> 28:30.480
It is truly my fortune

28:31.440 --> 28:34.240
to have the honor
of befriending you, Sect Master.

28:35.270 --> 28:37.160
I will definitely pay a visit another day.

28:37.160 --> 28:38.590
I'll be waiting for you.

29:17.600 --> 29:18.670
Big Teapot.

29:19.640 --> 29:20.440
Sect Master.

29:20.880 --> 29:22.340
Your mission is complete.

29:22.530 --> 29:23.680
Go back to the hall.

29:26.240 --> 29:27.240
Sometimes,

29:27.270 --> 29:28.360
it's hard to tell

29:28.890 --> 29:29.810
who's the prey.

29:34.150 --> 29:35.150
He has the ledger.

29:35.220 --> 29:36.070
Let me go with you.

29:36.070 --> 29:36.600
No need.

29:37.250 --> 29:39.380
Stay here and keep an eye on them for me.

29:47.700 --> 29:48.760
The ledger is gone.

29:48.790 --> 29:50.250
I need to go see for myself.

29:50.350 --> 29:51.750
What's going on with you?

29:52.550 --> 29:54.880
Will there be trouble if you go?

29:55.160 --> 29:55.880
Brother!

29:57.860 --> 29:58.620
Brother!

29:58.650 --> 30:00.080
Wait at the door.

30:00.400 --> 30:01.870
If I really can't handle it,

30:01.870 --> 30:03.310
I'll fire a shot as a signal,

30:03.310 --> 30:04.550
and then you rush in.

30:05.640 --> 30:07.480
There are too many people around.

30:07.480 --> 30:09.960
Why don't we just make a move early?

30:09.990 --> 30:11.880
The finale hasn't started yet.

30:12.810 --> 30:13.810
If we act early,

30:14.310 --> 30:15.920
there will be no show.

30:15.950 --> 30:17.520
Seal the courtyard!

30:17.830 --> 30:18.830
Even if you have to

30:18.830 --> 30:20.160
dig everywhere,

30:20.350 --> 30:22.160
find this person for me!

30:22.400 --> 30:23.930
We can't hide here for long.

30:24.920 --> 30:25.580
Silly prey,

30:26.150 --> 30:27.280
until we meet again.

30:29.070 --> 30:29.750
Shangguan.

30:42.090 --> 30:42.680
Master,

30:43.160 --> 30:43.920
are you okay?

30:44.570 --> 30:46.000
Shangguan Chengming.

30:47.500 --> 30:48.980
Interesting.

30:50.830 --> 30:54.880
[Yucheng]

30:58.720 --> 31:00.120
Three hundred years ago,

31:00.170 --> 31:02.440
Fang Zhaoyu,
one of the Five Ancestors of Hongmen,

31:02.440 --> 31:04.110
founded the Tianxiang Sect.

31:04.510 --> 31:05.270
Since then,

31:05.510 --> 31:08.070
we have allied with
heroes from all quarters,

31:08.350 --> 31:10.960
bringing joy to all the common people.

31:11.790 --> 31:12.640
Back then,

31:13.200 --> 31:14.440
your mentor,

31:14.830 --> 31:15.830
Zhang Dancheng,

31:16.350 --> 31:18.280
and I kowtowed together right here

31:18.960 --> 31:19.890
to join the sect.

31:20.350 --> 31:21.680
From now on,

31:21.880 --> 31:24.200
you are disciples of the Tianxiang Sect.

31:24.380 --> 31:25.910
Loyalty and righteousness

31:26.030 --> 31:27.440
bring wealth and glory.

31:27.720 --> 31:29.030
Disloyalty and unrighteousness

31:29.030 --> 31:30.630
share the fate of this lotus.

31:30.790 --> 31:32.090
-I came from the mortal realm
-I came from the mortal realm

31:32.090 --> 31:33.640
-to practice physiognomy.
-to practice physiognomy.

31:33.640 --> 31:34.830
-Everything in the mortal world
-Everything in the mortal world

31:34.830 --> 31:36.110
-is already in the past.
-is already in the past.

31:36.110 --> 31:36.650
-Thunder may strike, and fire may burn,
-Thunder may strike, and fire may burn,

31:36.650 --> 31:38.510
-but the wind cannot be driven away.
-but the wind cannot be driven away.

31:38.510 --> 31:39.790
-In life and death,
-In life and death,

31:39.790 --> 31:41.880
-it's all within the art of physiognomy.
-it's all within the art of physiognomy.

31:41.880 --> 31:43.680
This is the oath your mentor and I

31:43.920 --> 31:45.510
took back then.

31:45.830 --> 31:47.220
Once you enter this sect,

31:47.220 --> 31:48.950
there is no turning back.

31:49.310 --> 31:51.310
My junior and I are like this,

31:51.920 --> 31:52.960
and so are you.

31:53.640 --> 31:54.550
What a pity.

31:55.100 --> 31:56.440
The person you hate the most

31:56.440 --> 31:58.440
has been by your side all along.

31:59.470 --> 32:01.330
It's just that you couldn't tell.

32:03.890 --> 32:04.960
I am not like you,

32:06.730 --> 32:08.190
changing your appearance

32:08.590 --> 32:09.880
and playing the fool.

32:10.400 --> 32:12.500
Under no circumstances
shall I change my name.

32:12.500 --> 32:15.350
My whole family died
at the hands of the Tianxiang Sect.

32:15.350 --> 32:17.150
Today, I failed to take revenge.

32:17.360 --> 32:20.220
I only regret that I can't kill you
with my own hands!

32:20.400 --> 32:21.640
You scared me.

32:28.680 --> 32:29.590
Look

32:30.350 --> 32:31.610
how red this flower is.

32:31.720 --> 32:34.890
But in your eyes, it's black.

32:37.590 --> 32:38.350
Why?

32:39.160 --> 32:40.960
Because everything you see,

32:41.590 --> 32:42.640
hear,

32:43.160 --> 32:44.240
and smell

32:45.030 --> 32:47.030
is what your mentor taught you.

32:48.720 --> 32:50.450
Your mentor is highly skilled.

32:51.070 --> 32:52.070
Too bad

32:52.640 --> 32:54.640
he couldn't overcome his greed.

32:54.880 --> 32:56.660
Do you think I'd believe what you say?

32:56.660 --> 32:58.830
Do you think I'd believe you,

32:59.330 --> 33:00.400
Wang Jiaxian?

33:03.440 --> 33:05.130
A name is just a label.

33:06.160 --> 33:07.820
Everyone calls you Sect Master,

33:07.820 --> 33:09.350
but are you really a master?

33:09.790 --> 33:12.200
You do things only a coward would do.

33:15.850 --> 33:18.130
No matter what, he saved my life.

33:18.320 --> 33:20.080
If I kill my savior,

33:20.400 --> 33:22.550
who in the underworld
will ever respect me?

33:22.550 --> 33:23.200
Master,

33:24.270 --> 33:24.830
this man

33:25.110 --> 33:26.360
has ulterior motives.

33:26.360 --> 33:28.090
Keeping him around is a threat.

33:28.240 --> 33:29.770
It's best to eliminate him.

33:33.630 --> 33:35.290
You haven't eaten yet, right?

33:35.600 --> 33:36.800
Get something to eat.

34:11.630 --> 34:12.550
Are you okay?

34:21.840 --> 34:22.900
What are you doing?

34:27.190 --> 34:28.250
What are you doing?

34:29.659 --> 34:30.179
Bro!

34:30.550 --> 34:31.070
Bro!

34:34.230 --> 34:35.389
I'm Silly Liang!

34:37.840 --> 34:38.770
I'm Silly Liang!

34:42.280 --> 34:42.880
I know

34:43.409 --> 34:44.440
you're mad at me.

34:45.960 --> 34:47.400
I had no choice.

34:47.800 --> 34:48.920
Sect Master arranged for me

34:48.920 --> 34:50.920
to be the spy of the Longxuya Branch.

34:51.000 --> 34:52.350
But when we got to the Qian family,

34:52.350 --> 34:53.949
he replaced me.

34:54.190 --> 34:55.800
I'm just a gofer.

34:56.670 --> 34:58.150
I had to follow orders.

35:09.070 --> 35:10.510
Eat something.

35:10.800 --> 35:12.130
You'll recover faster.

35:16.280 --> 35:17.940
Sect Master won't let you eat.

35:18.460 --> 35:19.830
I brought this for you.

35:20.400 --> 35:22.190
I've already broken the sect rules.

35:22.190 --> 35:23.790
He will definitely find out.

35:23.880 --> 35:25.480
I won't escape a beating.

35:26.440 --> 35:29.370
If you don't eat,
I'll take that beating for nothing.

35:34.190 --> 35:35.550
I gotta go.

35:42.590 --> 35:44.400
I haven't told anyone

35:45.320 --> 35:47.780
what you said
when you were drunk that night.

35:53.360 --> 35:54.320
I'm telling you, bro,

35:54.320 --> 35:56.380
I'll follow you no matter what you do.

35:56.500 --> 35:58.560
What if I want to kill the Sect Master?

35:59.480 --> 36:00.520
Don't talk nonsense.

36:00.520 --> 36:02.720
Ruhui, do you really have what it takes?

36:06.720 --> 36:07.470
Liang,

36:08.120 --> 36:09.250
take my advice.

36:09.670 --> 36:11.130
Leave the Tianxiang Sect.

36:11.650 --> 36:12.560
None of them

36:13.840 --> 36:15.300
will die a peaceful death.

36:22.000 --> 36:23.200
Push a little harder.

36:25.070 --> 36:25.670
Master.

36:27.760 --> 36:28.550
The kid

36:28.960 --> 36:30.760
was boasting about killing you.

36:31.230 --> 36:33.030
Why didn't you let me finish him?

36:34.150 --> 36:35.550
Haven't I told you already?

36:35.550 --> 36:36.810
You're doing it again.

36:37.230 --> 36:38.320
You want to use him

36:39.150 --> 36:40.680
to draw out Zhang Dancheng?

36:41.150 --> 36:42.350
But it's been so long,

36:42.460 --> 36:44.790
and there's no sign of movement out there.

36:45.510 --> 36:46.590
What's the rush?

36:48.000 --> 36:49.880
I think this kid is quite smart.

36:50.320 --> 36:52.320
He might be of use to me in the future.

36:52.710 --> 36:53.440
But if he

36:53.800 --> 36:55.200
really is Wang Jiaxian,

36:55.880 --> 36:57.670
we wiped out his entire family.

36:57.920 --> 37:00.050
And I can tell he's a tough nut to crack.

37:00.280 --> 37:01.340
Keeping him around

37:01.510 --> 37:02.510
will be a problem.

37:12.750 --> 37:14.210
Is he really Wang Jiaxian?

37:25.480 --> 37:26.940
Do something for me later.

37:27.710 --> 37:28.480
What is it?

37:38.280 --> 37:40.280
I really took a beating for nothing.

37:43.800 --> 37:45.400
Sect Master wants to see you.

37:57.840 --> 37:58.880
You're here.

37:59.550 --> 38:01.150
Join us if you haven't eaten.

38:10.110 --> 38:10.880
Yanzi.

38:12.070 --> 38:12.930
Do you know him?

38:13.960 --> 38:15.000
No, Master.

38:15.150 --> 38:16.550
Then I don't understand.

38:16.710 --> 38:17.760
Why would someone

38:18.440 --> 38:20.540
who just narrowly escaped death
at the Qian family

38:20.540 --> 38:22.120
rush to see someone

38:22.150 --> 38:23.800
he doesn't even know?

38:25.990 --> 38:28.420
Isn't it because he wanted
to get the banknotes back

38:28.420 --> 38:29.970
to report to Commander Feng?

38:29.970 --> 38:31.600
Because I wanted to kill you
with my own hands.

38:31.600 --> 38:32.250
For money?

38:34.000 --> 38:34.600
For lives.

38:35.150 --> 38:36.790
Years ago, with a song of "Yu Linglong,"

38:36.790 --> 38:38.390
you killed my family of four.

38:38.600 --> 38:40.130
I kept you alive until today

38:41.570 --> 38:43.970
because I didn't want
you to die too easily.

38:45.960 --> 38:46.630
Okay,

38:47.000 --> 38:48.390
that's a well-made-up story.

38:48.390 --> 38:50.520
Too bad you're not the main character.

38:50.630 --> 38:51.720
Wang Jiaxian

38:52.130 --> 38:54.260
died in the Nanxi River a long time ago.

38:55.360 --> 38:56.590
What is this nonsense?

38:56.590 --> 38:57.400
One minute it's for money,

38:57.400 --> 38:58.660
the next it's for life.

38:59.190 --> 39:00.390
Let's keep it simple.

39:01.190 --> 39:02.920
If you really are Wang Jiaxian,

39:03.140 --> 39:03.980
kill her

39:04.360 --> 39:06.020
and avenge your whole family.

39:06.470 --> 39:07.680
If you're not,

39:08.070 --> 39:08.590
Yanzi,

39:09.090 --> 39:10.380
kill him for me.

39:10.490 --> 39:11.530
Then send his head

39:11.760 --> 39:12.920
to my junior.

39:21.290 --> 39:22.620
Don't just stand there.

39:23.220 --> 39:23.900
Do it.

39:38.400 --> 39:39.040
Master.

39:40.380 --> 39:41.780
You're back just in time.

39:42.000 --> 39:43.400
I went to the Wang family.

39:44.060 --> 39:46.060
I found Wang Jiaxian's grave.

39:47.440 --> 39:49.070
[Tomb of Wang Jiaxian]

39:51.250 --> 39:52.520
I dug it up...

39:56.440 --> 39:57.640
and saw bones inside.

39:59.590 --> 40:01.630
If you are Wang Jiaxian,

40:02.100 --> 40:03.290
then whose bones are those?

40:03.290 --> 40:05.190
You heartless jerks
dug up someone's grave!

40:05.190 --> 40:06.800
That's only because you lied

40:07.010 --> 40:08.300
and made a dead man die again.

40:08.300 --> 40:09.260
Old man,

40:09.720 --> 40:11.550
kill me now if you have the guts!

41:14.880 --> 41:15.880
Sect Master.

41:16.590 --> 41:18.250
Ghost Gate Thirteen Needles.

41:26.880 --> 41:29.320
[30 years ago]

41:29.980 --> 41:33.230
[Young Sect Master Zhou Xingsi]

41:56.710 --> 41:58.150
I have searched the world,

41:58.150 --> 41:59.810
but no one can cure my illness.

42:00.800 --> 42:02.800
My father also died of this disease.

42:03.650 --> 42:04.370
Hong,

42:04.870 --> 42:06.130
thankfully, I met you.

42:08.710 --> 42:11.440
Aren't you afraid
I won't be around in the future?

42:13.140 --> 42:14.270
Do not worry.

42:15.280 --> 42:17.370
I have already taught this
acupuncture technique to Zhang Dancheng

42:17.370 --> 42:18.510
and Qin Baichuan.

42:19.000 --> 42:20.760
In the future,
whenever I am out on a mission

42:20.760 --> 42:21.820
and not at the hall,

42:22.280 --> 42:24.010
your two Juniors will help you.

42:24.590 --> 42:25.320
Is my illness

42:25.520 --> 42:26.560
truly incurable?

42:26.840 --> 42:29.170
This illness was passed down
from your father.

42:29.170 --> 42:31.570
It tends to flare up
whenever you are tense.

42:31.640 --> 42:33.960
The Ghost Gate Thirteen Needles
can't cure it completely

42:33.960 --> 42:36.400
because you have too many secrets
in your heart,

42:36.400 --> 42:38.660
and they have weighed on you for too long.

42:39.000 --> 42:40.030
I have heard

42:40.280 --> 42:43.740
that this acupuncture technique
can capture a person's soul.

42:44.060 --> 42:45.920
Capturing souls is just a saying.

42:46.630 --> 42:47.280
Senior,

42:48.070 --> 42:49.880
the reason you feel relieved now

42:50.400 --> 42:51.770
is that one of these

42:52.070 --> 42:52.920
13 needles

42:53.280 --> 42:55.280
helps you strip away your disguise.

42:57.460 --> 42:58.990
A person without a disguise

42:59.330 --> 43:00.930
is like a child who can't lie.

43:03.120 --> 43:05.250
With the Ghost Gate Thirteen Needles,

43:06.420 --> 43:08.880
we can even summon his soul
for questioning.

43:13.990 --> 43:15.150
But I don't know

43:15.630 --> 43:17.030
if this kid can take it.

43:17.510 --> 43:19.880
He's quite sturdy.

43:20.960 --> 43:22.020
Apply the needles.

43:52.880 --> 43:54.590
Who exactly are you?

44:00.030 --> 44:00.920
I am...

44:09.740 --> 44:11.890
[In the next episode]

44:12.250 --> 44:13.210
It's just a meal.

44:13.710 --> 44:14.420
And you're even taking photos?

44:14.420 --> 44:15.410
Usually,

44:15.440 --> 44:16.760
only once momentous deeds
are accomplished,

44:16.760 --> 44:17.880
we have food and money.

44:17.880 --> 44:18.410
Dismiss.

44:18.920 --> 44:19.460
What's wrong?

44:19.460 --> 44:21.940
It must be those jerks
of the Plum Blossom Sect.

44:21.940 --> 44:23.650
What kind of miracle is this?

44:23.680 --> 44:24.430
What miracle?

44:24.430 --> 44:26.150
The immortal children ascend to heaven.

44:26.150 --> 44:27.150
Welcome.

44:27.440 --> 44:30.170
The immortal children
will climb the staircase.

44:42.280 --> 44:43.320
How dare you!

44:43.320 --> 44:44.230
Who are you?

44:44.230 --> 44:46.030
How dare you stop the immortal children
from ascending?
